<title>PHILIPPINES: Lorenzo Jan-Mar net 15.40 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Lorenzo Jan-Mar net 15.40 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lorenzo Shipping Corp said on Wednesday its unaudited net profit in the first three months of the year reached 15.40 million pesos.</p>
<p>It said it made 169.99 million pesos in net revenues.</p>
<p>The shipping firm did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>--Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
